      "title": "START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Image-to-image variation (experimental)\nUpload your own image in Load Image and describe the finished image in the positive prompt.\n\nDenoise controls change: 0.25–0.4 retains more structure; 0.5–0.7 changes more. The default is 0.6. Resizing retains the input aspect ratio near 1 megapixel.\n\nThis uses ordinary VAE encode and denoising with a text-to-image model. It does not provide instruction editing or identity preservation.\n\nImages save to output/moss/img2img/."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Image-to-image variation (experimental)\nUpload your own image in Load Image and describe the finished image in the positive prompt.\n\nDenoise controls change: 0.25–0.4 retains more structure; 0.5–0.7 changes more. The default is 0.6. Resizing retains the input aspect ratio near 1 megapixel.\n\nThis uses ordinary VAE encode and denoising with a text-to-image model. It does not provide instruction editing or identity preservation.\n\nImages save to output/moss/img2img/."
      },
      "color": "#254438",
      "bgcolor": "#232936"
    },
